{"id":"5122","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5122_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-with-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>积雨云是一种沉重密集的云，具有相当大或很大的垂直范围，呈现山或巨大的塔形式。上部至少有一部分通常是光滑的、纤维状的或条纹状的，并且几乎总是扁平的。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云底通常很暗</span>。在这个图像中的几个细胞，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上部具有卷云状外观</span>，可确定为鬃状云种。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状云正在发展</span>，这是砧状附加特征。还可以在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>处看到在云的下表面悬挂着乳房状的凸起或小球体；这些是乳房状附加特征，是由积雨云内强烈的下降气候引起的。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Anton van Niekerk","location":"南非米德兰Witpoort","latitude":"纬度: 25° 59' 23'' S","longitude":"经度: 28° 4' 4'' E","date":"31 December 2011 1854 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.6"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4767_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-mamma_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这个冬季砧状鬃积雨云一个突出特点是云下表面的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">类似于乳房状云的悬垂突起</span>。这是乳房状云的附加特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Gary Salisbury","location":"马恩岛","latitude":"纬度: 54° 6' 16'' N","longitude":"经度: 4° 36' 51'' W","date":"14 January 2011 1442 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.6"}]}]}